  description: '""BULLauncher" is a support machine specializing in bombardment and
    daytime combat that not only has the constantly refined "Coc-OS" and "BFS Armor",
    but it also has 3 "Foil-Packers" installed within it under orders of "Madera"
    after repeated trial and error. By installing a "Beef-Rifle" or other armaments,
    it can be used as medium- and long-range support for the "Steam Knights" and
    their operations. Also, "BULLauncher" can be combined with "WINGear", which specializes
    in high-speed aerial combat, and "BOARms", which specializes in melee and assault
    combat, to cause the high-calorie "Steam Jushin - BW" to descend upon this world."'
